{
  "meta": {
    "id": "10_blend_modes",
    "name": "调色展示-混合模式（multiply / screen / soft_light / overlay）",
    "author": "ImmersiveCinematics",
    "version": 3,
    "description": "层级混合（混合模式作用于调整层 = ADJUST 轨）展示：clip 级 blend_mode + 关键帧 blend_amount（0~1，缺省 1）。口径 c = mix(基画面, blend(基画面, 调整层输出, 模式), blend_amount)。0~8s multiply（调整层 exposure +0.3 / saturation +0.5 → 压暗增浓，blend_amount 0→1→0）；8~16s screen（exposure +0.5 / temperature +0.3 → 1-(1-a)(1-b) 提亮泛白暖）；16~24s soft_light（lightness +0.25 / vibrance +0.5 → W3C 柔光，柔和提亮增艳）；24~32s overlay（contrast +0.7 / saturation +0.5 → 基画面暗处走 multiply、亮处走 screen，高对比增艳）；32~40s 归零还原（blend_mode=normal + 全通道 0 + blend_amount=0，输出 = 基画面、画面逐位不变）。四段各自 blend_amount 0→1 渐入、1→0 渐出（2 秒），每段都是「调整层淡入 → 全量 → 淡出」。字段口径：blend_mode 枚举 normal / multiply / screen / soft_light / overlay（缺省 normal = 直替换）；blend_amount 0~1、缺省 1；两者只写在 ADJUST 轨（作用于整体画面 master，相机片段上写会被 validator 拦下）；只动 RGB，alpha 逐位直通，透明度只走合成参数 opacity。",
    "triggers": [ { "id": "trg_login", "type": "login", "repeatable": false, "delay": 409, "conditions": {} } ],
    "block_keyboard": false,
    "block_mouse": false,
    "hide_hud": false,
    "hide_arm": true,
    "suppress_bob": true,
    "pause_when_game_paused": true,
    "interruptible": true,
    "skippable": true,
    "hold_at_end": false,
    "render_player_model": true
  },
